## 13. Canonical commands

Environment:

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate   # macOS/Linux
# .venv\Scripts\activate   # Windows
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

Tests:

```bash
pytest
```

Lint:

```bash
ruff check .
```

App scaffold:

```bash
streamlit run app/main.py
```

Do not claim these pass unless actually executed in the environment used for the change.

