## 16. Before ending an agent session

If you materially change the project, leave it easier for the next agent:

- update this file when known facts/status/assumptions change;
- update `data/.ai_handoff` for data-specific discoveries;
- update `README.md` for stable human-facing information;
- update `docs/AI_USAGE.md` for material AI-assisted work;
- do not mark uncertain conclusions as confirmed facts;
- state what was tested and what remains unverified.
